        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ca duɔth lätnikɛ, kɛ lätkɛ tin gɔw kɛ tin ca gɔ̱r rɛy buɔk ŋuɔ̱tni Kuɔth Nhial, ",
          "type": "text",
